 "texts": {
  "be58fa4eeaa4": "Armed forces personnel who served in the Gulf War during 1990-1991 report more current ill-health than those who were not deployed. There has been concern expressed that they may also experience higher mortality rates. The aims of this study are to document the mortality experience of UK Gulf War veterans in the 8 years since the end of the war."
 }
